      `but for the information so obtained the person would not have reasonable grounds for knowing or suspecting that another person is engaged in money laundering` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 331(6B) the exception for information from an immigration check applies` MEANS
    `the information or other matter disclosed to the person under section 330 consists of or includes information that was obtained only in consequence of the carrying out of a status check under section 40 of the Immigration Act 2014 or an immigration check under section 40A of that Act or both`
    AND `but for the information so obtained the person would not have reasonable grounds for knowing or suspecting that another person is engaged in money laundering`

